<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63060" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοτεινὸς καὶ μέλας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i> (prob. referring to <i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i> where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διερῷ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θολερῷ</span> codd. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>, as epith. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠήρ</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; νύξ</span> expld. as either <i>dark</i> or
			(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβάς</span>) <i>dewy</i> night,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				564.49
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβρὸν σέλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
					232
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλὸς λ.</span> either
			<i>black</i> or <i>dripping</i> blood, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				15.25.1
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Besant.
			</span></i>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμβρός</span>.</div>
